Package: tn5bias
Type: Package
Title: tn5bias: Tn5 sequence bias for ATAC-seq
Version: 0.99.1
Date: 2025-06-17
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pierre-Luc", "Germain", email="pierre-luc.germain@hest.ethz.ch",
            role=c("cre","aut"), comment=c(ORCID="0000-0003-3418-4218")))
Description:
  This packages computes a per-nucleotide Tn5 sequence bias for any given DNA sequence.
  The 10-mer bias pre-computed using SELMA on naked human DNA (but should be applicable to other species),
  and are applied using both strands (Hu et al., 2022).
  The bias can then be used to correct ATAC coverage signal.
